    "gm_notes": "<p>These primates are often found in jungles and other heavily forested areas. Some live in the low branches of the trees while others prefer to dwell on the ground. Typically non-violent unless provoked, they can still pose a threat. This beast was built by selecting a CR 5 Biped (slam attack) and giving it the charge ability and improving its strength to simulate a shocking simian assault.</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
